## Context
User directive: skills must be portable and name roles, capability classes and
semantic effort rather than concrete models. Cheaper workers and smartest
advisors are role intentions; runtime configuration supplies identities.
Related tracker: 0974 (this slice does not close that broader program).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] External reviewer discovery and routing are delegated to the runtime; helpers are optional.
- [ ] Harness AGENTS.md opens with requested profiles and runtime selection guidance.
- [ ] Skill Markdown and frontmatter contain no concrete model choices.
- [ ] Worker/advisor guidance and effort use the portable vocabulary.
- [ ] Runtime model mappings remain separate from skill instructions.
- [ ] Portability regression checks reject named models and invalid controls.
- [ ] Review findings are resolved and the full gate passes, with any independently
      reproduced baseline failures documented.
